format 1

# lablith's own GitLab registry: the pipeline its GitLab mirror runs,
# rendered by `lablith gen` (nix:T32). The same row as .actlith's, so
# both forges run the same hk gate with the same cache (.:V4).

## workflows
id|kind|systems|cache|args
ci|gate|-|pr0d1r2|-

# The private mirror's runners are x86_64-linux only (src/system:R8); the
# arm systems stay gated on GitHub and are skipped here (src/system:V72).
## runners
system|tags
aarch64-linux|-
aarch64-darwin|-
